'''Isle of the Map Lord''' (地図王の眠る島, ''Chizu-ō no Nemuru Shima'', '''Sleeping Island of the Map King''') was a set of special stages that always dropped [[Enigma Stages|Enigmas]] for [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] stages. This event was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]] alongside Talent Orbs, and was removed in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]], being replaced by the [[Island of Hidden Treasure]].

