==Overview==
As shown above, this map contained three stages. The stages got progressively harder, but each had better chances for a rarer Enigma than the last. Each stage would only drop one Enigma per clear.

Because the Summit and Frontier stages only had a marginally better chance to drop high-tier Orbs, it was optimal to only farm Compass Mound and always get Cradle Stages. However, Atlas Archeology can be rushed, so it could be farmed faster.
