==Trivia==
*Due to an error, this event originally had the same Enigma drop rates as any other [[Legend Stages|Legend Stage]] in the [[The Battle Cats|English Version]]. The drop rates were soon fixed, and all players received a free [[Cat Energy|Leadership]] as compensation.
*Before [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]], this event did not show up on the event calendar.
**Additionally, the stage name had a different look.

